#: ../../source/index.rst:53
msgid ""
"The project supports fixed point-charge embedding, Monte Carlo solvation, and quantum"
" resource estimates. It does not include polarizable MM or an SQD-MC loop. The SQD "
"implementation uses a classical simulator."
msgstr "项目支持固定点电荷嵌入、Monte Carlo 溶剂化和量子资源估算。它不包含可极化 MM 或 SQD-MC 循环。SQD 实现使用经典模拟器。"

