#: ../../source/index.rst:92
msgid ""
"Cite the Zenodo archive when you use q2m3 in research. The concept DOI identifies the"
" project across releases. Use a version DOI to identify the exact code behind a "
"result. ``CITATION.cff`` lists the project citation and the ``v0.1.1`` DOI "
"`10.5281/zenodo.20114946 <https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20114946>`_."
msgstr ""
"在研究中使用 q2m3 时，请引用 Zenodo 归档。概念 DOI 标识跨版本的项目。版本 DOI 标识产生结果的确切代码。``CITATION.cff`` "
"列出项目引用信息及 ``v0.1.1`` 的 DOI `10.5281/zenodo.20114946 "
"<https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20114946>`_。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:48
msgid ""
"q2m3 is a Python framework for small-molecule QM/MM calculations. It combines PySCF "
"chemistry with PennyLane quantum phase estimation (QPE) and sample-based quantum "
"diagonalization (SQD). Fragment workflows apply the counterpoise correction to "
"interaction energies from several electronic structure methods."
msgstr ""
"q2m3 是用于小分子 QM/MM 计算的 Python 框架。它结合 PySCF 化学计算、PennyLane "
"量子相位估计（QPE）和基于采样的量子对角化（SQD）。片段工作流比较不同电子结构方法的 counterpoise 修正相互作用能。"
